{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\",\n    \"The increased coherence between the PMC and STN may reflect a compensatory mechanism to maintain motor control in the face of disrupted cortical signals; however, this abnormal coupling could also contribute to the rigidity and motor impairments characteristic of FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\",\n    \"During normal turning, significantly higher PMC-STN alpha coherence was observed in the TurnPre phase (p = 0.0045, Fig. 3A). In contrast, during turning freeze, there was an increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.048) and a decrease in M1-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.043) during the TurnStart phase (Fig. 3B).\",\n    \"The increased coherence between the PMC and STN may reflect a compensatory mechanism to maintain motor control in the face of disrupted cortical signals; however, this abnormal coupling could also contribute to the rigidity and motor impairments characteristic of FOG.\",\n    \"B Freezing of Turning: A delayed and exaggerated increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence and concurrent decoupling of M1-STN alpha coherence was observed during the TurnStart phase.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法只能部分得到全文支持。首先，报告称原文没有说明相关方向，这与图4图注明确矛盾：原研究明确指出，TurnPre阶段相对于行走状态增强的PMC-STN alpha coherence预测更短的冻结发作。这是具有机制区分价值的方向性结果，不能仅概括为存在相关关系。其次，原文讨论确实同时提出了代偿性耦合和病理性耦合两种可能解释，因此将其描述为竞争性解释有依据；但将二者视为基本对等，忽略了TurnPre阶段增强的耦合与更短冻结持续时间之间的关系，缺少重要限定。指控者的判断也只能部分得到支持：其关于相关方向的描述有明确原文依据，而且这一方向确实更符合代偿性解释；但原文没有正式宣布H4优于H5。讨论仍然保留了病理性解释，并且明确区分了TurnPre阶段与冻结发生时TurnStart阶段延迟且夸大的PMC-STN alpha coherence增强。因此，更准确的结论是：TurnPre阶段的持续时间预测结果为H4提供了相对更有利的证据，但不足以据此排除H5或认定原研究已经完成了两个机制假说的正式比较。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b3dda08d-e867-46f3-8774-1b61b5563502", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114210937867Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:43:47.091947+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "27dc0d55fb0550c2e3590fb7f66043a6091f09e8e76798326d8c20627efffdd6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114210937867Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "105f7253ae468f998206ff694a012b941893786736c218bd